<h1>&#9888; High Dengue Risk Detected</h1>

<p>Hi {{recipientName}},</p>

<p>
  Epidemiological surveillance data has identified an elevated dengue risk level in <strong>{{district}}</strong> district that requires immediate attention.
</p>

<div class="alert-box">
  <p>&#9888; Alert Level: <strong>{{alertLevel}}</strong> &mdash; {{description}}</p>
</div>

<hr class="divider" />

<h2>{{district}} District — Week {{weekNumber}}, {{year}}</h2>

<table class="detail-list">
  <tr>
    <td>Current Cases</td>
    <td><strong>{{currentCases}}</strong></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>4-Week Average</td>
    <td>{{avgCases}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Alert Level</td>
    <td>{{alertLevel}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Surveillance Week</td>
    <td>Week {{weekNumber}}, {{year}}</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<div class="warning-box">
  <p><strong>Recommended Actions:</strong></p>
  <p>Deploy field PHI teams to affected areas, increase surveillance frequency, and coordinate with the district medical officer for immediate response.</p>
</div>

{{#if dashboardUrl}}
<div class="btn-wrap">
  <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="btn">View Analytics Dashboard</a>
</div>
{{/if}}

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #90a4ae;">
  This alert is generated automatically by the Epilink epidemiological surveillance system. Contact your district medical officer or system administrator for guidance.
</p>
